  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">Yarmouth Art Guild</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-2321 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-the-gallery category-news tag-cape-cod-artist tag-doris-mee tag-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-yarmouth-art-guild\" id=\"post-2321\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/yarmouth-art-guild-spring-show/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"575\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A woman wearing a scarf is seen attending an art exhibition organized by The Guild of Harwich Artists.\" src=\"/media/archive/303f8efc59107fc252a337cb7564565509af18e8ffd8168535b853505dc692e0.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/yarmouth-art-guild-spring-show/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Yarmouth Art Guild Spring Show</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-04-17T21:54:38-04:00\" title=\"Monday, April 17, 2017, 9:54 pm\">April 17, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Guild of Harwich Artists President, Doris Mee, won First Prize for her mixed media piece, “Sunset Over the Dune” in the Yarmouth Art Guild Spring Show at The Cultural Center <a href=\"/news/yarmouth-art-guild-spring-show/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-2561 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-education category-events category-monthly-meetings category-news tag-acrylic-artist tag-cape-cod-artist tag-guild-of-harwi